<p><a href="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sumiyoshi1/IMG_6474.png"><img alt="IMG_6474.png" src="https://www.supercourt.jp/blog/sumiyoshi1/assets_c/2024/04/IMG_6474-thumb-500xauto-180859.png" width="500" height="470" class="mt-image-center" style="text-align: center; display: block; margin: 0 auto 20px;" /></a></p>]]>
        
